column3:
Step 1: Open DevTools Application Tab
Press F12 to open Developer Tools
Click on the Application tab
On the left sidebar, expand Storage section
Step 2: Clear Both Storage Layers
In the left sidebar, click Local Storage → http://localhost:3002
Select all entries (Ctrl+A or Cmd+A)
Press Delete to clear localStorage
Repeat for Session Storage:
Click Session Storage → http://localhost:3002
Select all entries and delete
Step 3: Block localStorage
Open Console tab in DevTools
Paste and run this code:
Object.defineProperty(window, 'localStorage', {
  get: function() {
    throw new DOMException('localStorage is not available', 'SecurityError');
  },
  configurable: true
});
